                                                "sense_id": "d6832fee-aad2-371c-9567-b1128519df5d",
                                                "text": "2012, Sophia Kingshill, The Estate of Jennifer Westwood, The Fabled Coast\nOvernight, North Shields was cordoned off by soldiers while the pressers descended in force, and left with a haul of more than two hundred and fifty men, including sailors, mechanics, and every kind of labourer."
                                            }
