                                                "sense_id": "31373e06-2db7-3058-af04-f0cc7d34a790",
                                                "text": "He saw the man who did the cleaning and pressing for the hotel, a man whom he had always seen before in the gloom of the pressing shop sweating over a steam presser."
                                            }
